{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34307","headline":"袭美见题郊居十首因次韵酬之以伸荣谢 一 · 陆龟蒙","name":"袭美见题郊居十首因次韵酬之以伸荣谢 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"近来唯乐静，移傍故城居。\n闲打修琴料，时封谢药书。\n夜停江上鸟，晴晒箧中鱼。\n出亦图何事，无劳置栈车。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34307.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34307","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}